{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X少数叙事改写加入了原文未明确交代的判断，例如S12的“让对方安心”和S14的“却不后悔”，在叙事准确性上略逊于Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮关键词能让观众迅速抓住每段的心理转折，话与感受上下衔接，加上按音乐小节出现的提示，不必一次读完所有信息也能跟上。它反复使用水面、船身、摇荡、声线等意象，把最初的小心、逐渐靠近、中途的不安直到最后接受不确定性连成一条线，音乐感受也比Y更具体、更有层次。Y的叙事文字其实更完整自然，因果交代也很稳，但右侧感受词较多是并列呈现，观众需要自己把它们重新组织成情绪过程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c680045c-a475-403a-88d5-15e86a9b9abe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054209644528Z", "elapsed_seconds": 120.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:44:10.530896+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "253b2cda42c1cba414e9fa55e725f4b1bb9be2b5791f7137585eb837bfc38960", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c